<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Donation Completed - Daan</title>


<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f7f7f7;
    color: #333;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #16a34a;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #16a34a;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: #222;
    margin: 10px 0 20px;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .highlight {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #16a34a;
  }

  .amount {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    background: #f0fdf4;
    color: #16a34a;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .details {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 15px;
    background: #f9fafb;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .details p {
    margin: 8px 0;
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 30px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #888;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>


  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo"> Daan</div>


  <div class="icon">&#10003;</div>

  <h2>Donation Completed Successfully</h2>

  <p>
    Hello <%= name %>,
  </p>

  <p>
    Thank you for making a meaningful contribution through
    <span class="highlight">Daan - Donate With Trust</span>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Your donation has been successfully completed and recorded in our
    system.
  </p>

  <div class="amount">
    <%= amount %>
  </div>

  <div class="details">
    <p>
      <strong>Donation ID:</strong>
      <%= donationId %>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Request:</strong>
      <%= requestTitle %>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Status:</strong>
      <span class="highlight">COMPLETED</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    Your support can make a real difference in someone's life. Thank you
    for choosing to donate with trust.
  </p>

  <div class="footer">
    Daan - Donate With Trust<br />
    Connecting hearts through trusted giving.
  </div>
</div>


  </body>
</html>
